  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "file": "SC056",
   "section": "It's happening again",
   "narration": "Some poachers even poison elephant carcasses on purpose, because circling vultures can lead rangers straight to an illegal kill. In one case in Namibia, around five hundred vultures died at a single carcass.",
